.SS "void SystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.ITypeBuffer< T >\&.Clear ()"

.PP
Clears the buffer content and resets any internal usage state\&. This method zeroes the underlying storage and resets usage counters (if any)\&. It does not modify external cursors or positions that are managed outside the buffer instance\&. 
.PP
Implemented in \fBSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.TypeBuffer< T >\fP\&.
